From 4ed42c093d0d38179c4d623a1c4e08babb5a27f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TickTrade Workbench <workbench@local>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:54:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] security(api): honour CORS_ORIGIN / WS_CORS_ORIGIN
 allowlists; keep Swagger UI off in production unless SWAGGER_ENABLED=true

Both variables were already declared in env.validation.ts but never read: HTTP and every Socket.IO gateway reflected any Origin with credentials:true. Empty variables keep the old reflect-all behaviour (with a boot warning in production) so nothing breaks before the list is configured. Adds cors.util.spec.ts and documents the knobs in .env.example.
